WEBVTT

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.220
Why won't this come off?

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.930
There's no way you can take it off.

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.350
Yuuya-oniichan's pudding is so awesome!

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.330
Can't you eat it normally?

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.660
But Yuuya-oniichan bought this pudding!

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.750
Of course it's going to be yummy!

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.460
Why are you calling him "Onii-chan"? I thought he was an only child.

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.820
How do you know him?

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.460
In fact, what are you?

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:35.150
If you're a ghost, go to Heaven already!

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:38.990
In order to do that, a whole
bunch of things has to happen.

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:39.800
Like what?

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.810
At first I wanted to possess your body.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:47.450
But you were too strong of spirit and pushed me out.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.900
So there's been a change in plans!

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:54.150
You're going to lend me a hand!

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:56.270
Lend a hand?

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:57.570
Interstice of Time!

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.470
Reveal thyself to me!

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:07.530
What's this?

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:08.920
What's going on?

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:55.870
Is this...

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:57.650
Are you kidding?

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:01.090
What happened to me?

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.330
Did I just... die?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.420
No, you're still alive.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:07.270
But, we're...

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.960
I'm the only one who's dead.

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.960
I was hit by a vehicle at that intersection.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:17.770
And I died without telling my beloved
Yuuya-oniichan how I felt.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.630
I think!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.230
I'm not sure what happened.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:26.330
I haven't retained much of my memories.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:29.480
All I do remember is that I love Yuuya-oniichan.

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.320
The next thing I knew, here I was.

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.230
Everything else is just a blank.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:39.270
So I can't tell you how I knew Yuuya-oniichan.

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:42.610
Well, I <i>do</i> think that's a cruel fate.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.110
You think so? Do you really?

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:46.990
Yeah.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.910
Then you're willing to help?

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:55.630
Hey, I sort of asked this girl
to help me. Is that all right?

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.340
Cool! They said yes!

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.370
Yes to what?

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.910
In order to pass into the next life,

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.730
I need to go through that celestial gate.

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:11.640
You can fly up there, can't you?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:17.270
I have to create a stairwell in order to reach it.

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:19.980
These are the steps I've already made.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.540
How <i>do</i> you make one?

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:25.130
Look at the heart on your T.S.T.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:31.720
That gauge shows the level of
satisfaction I get from my love life.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:37.170
I'm not in Heaven because there's so much I wanted to do with Onii-chan.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:41.000
There's so much I want to experience as his girlfriend.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:44.460
The more satisfaction I get,
the more power the gauge collects.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.730
Each time the gauge is filled, one more step is created.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:54.440
So all I need to do is take over your body and get lovey-dovey with Onii-chan!

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.350
Lovey-dovey?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:57.400
Like kissing...

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.110
Dating...

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.570
And having sex!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.910
A-Are you crazy?

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:06.570
Why would I ever...

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:10.910
Besides, he's technically my brother. We can't do that.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:14.870
But if I don't get into Heaven,
you'll be wearing that thing for life.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.870
So there you have it. What do you say, Mitsuki?

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:20.990
I can't! I can't! I can't!

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:25.510
I don't care what you say! That's not happening!

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:35.020
Was that... all a dream?

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:35.640
Morning!

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.290
Did you have a dirty dream?

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:53.290
Kyouko-san, what time is your flight?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.890
I believe it's after 4 PM.

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:58.790
Can you tell Dad I said hi once you arrive?

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:02.250
Of course. I'll call when I get there.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.530
Thanks for the food.

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:08.910
Mitsuki!

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:10.540
Goodbye.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.630
Forgive me, Yuuya-kun.

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.190
Oh, sure.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.520
Mitsuki, now look...

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.830
Have a safe trip.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.740
You sure about this?

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.870
Isn't your mother traveling overseas?

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:41.060
How was the test?

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:43.210
I totally blew it.

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:47.800
Yuuya, we have gym next. Let's go.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.910
Oh, you're right.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.070
Hey, have you seen Mitsuki?

00:06:58.070 --> 00:07:00.700
I saw her leave the classroom.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:04.170
Really? I guess she decided to change early.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:09.240
Why are you changing in here?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.070
I can't have people see me wearing this.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.200
Oh, right.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:15.550
Well, it just takes some getting used to.

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.830
You'll soon get the hang of it.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.150
How does <i>anyone</i> get the hang of it?

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:22.030
Think of it as a pair of glasses.

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:23.570
You'll soon forget it's there!

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:26.230
I've never actually worn glasses before.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:26.960
Ah!

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:31.350
How will you have sex with Onii-chan
if it only comes off for three minutes?

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.640
Shut up!

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:40.020
Why's she so grumpy?

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.070
Oh, Mitsuki!

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.070
Ayaka?

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:45.460
I thought you left without us.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.080
Oh, sorry.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:47.860
Huh?

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.190
Is that your uniform?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.370
Oh, uh...

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:56.250
I'm so stupid! Let me put it in the locker room.

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:59.410
Why not use your shoe locker?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.540
Oh yeah, you're right.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.820
We're doing 100-meter dashes today.

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:05.570
I can't contain myself.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:07.500
God, this is so boring!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.010
I wanna go home and get busy with Onii-chan!

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.340
We can't do anything together at school!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.850
Will you shut up for just one minute?

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:18.850
I know there's nothing special about them,

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:21.760
but 100-meter dashes still make me nervous.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.790
I think they're more annoying than nerve-racking.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.630
The 11th-grade boys have gym too.

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:31.310
Mitsuki?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.120
Hey, Mitsuki?!

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:39.910
I swear, Mitsuki-chan is too cute!

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:46.390
What happened? Someone you know?

00:08:48.030 --> 00:08:49.560
Get set!

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:50.630
Go!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:55.630
All right! We have the same class as Yuuya-oniichan!

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:56.410
Lucky us!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:57.310
<i>What's so great about gym during wintertime?
Lucky us!</i>

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:58.750
<i>What's so great about gym during wintertime?</i>

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:00.850
Mitsuki, don't you like gym?

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:03.310
Not much. I don't run fast either.

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:06.740
I used to like gym. And I was a fast runner.

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:09.190
That's something you remember?

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:11.910
At least I think I was.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:13.110
Seriously?

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:16.110
Next up is Kanzaki-san and Kimijima-san! Get ready!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.150
Coming!

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:22.370
Kanzaki-san?!

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:25.790
Kanzaki-san?

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:29.350
Coming.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.090
Hey, Mitsuki!

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.970
Let me run the 100-meter dash!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:37.550
Huh?

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.130
On your marks!

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:46.980
Get set!

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.100
Go!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.070
She's fast!

00:09:58.650 --> 00:09:59.630
Goal!

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.510
Kanzaki-san! Twelve seconds flat!

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:03.890
You're really fast!

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:04.950
I guess so.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:08.710
Wow, Mitsuki-chan moves fast!

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:09.670
Her?

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.300
He's watching!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.130
Onii-<i>chan saw the whole thing!</i>

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:17.090
Hey! This is cheating!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:21.730
I gotta do something to wow
Onii-<i>chan if I wanna tap that!</i>

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:24.750
Why should I care if he's wowed?

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:28.310
I need to get Onii-<i>chan to fall in love with me!</i>

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:30.390
I forgot to tell you that if nothing happens,

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:33.770
the satisfaction level on that gauge will steadily decrease.

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:38.610
If it falls below a certain reading, you and I will fall from that stairway and die!

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:42.640
So stop slacking and create a love life with Onii-<i>chan.</i>

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.160
Die? When were you planning to tell me that?

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:46.670
I didn't want to upset you.

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.210
Anyways, that's the rub!

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.880
Oh god...

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:53.910
I'm going to die?

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.170
Mitsuki?

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.630
That's amazing! Why don't you join the track team?

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:02.050
I couldn't believe it! I thought you hated gym!

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:05.600
Huh? Is something wrong?

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.740
Oh god... I'm going to die?

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:10.310
Oh shoot!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:13.780
That chill down my spine made
me want to use the restroom!

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.190
Kanzaki-san!

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:18.650
That's incredible! You're the fastest girl in school!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:19.010
Who could have known?

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:20.230
This puts her in a new light.
Who could have known?

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:21.250
Is she on a team?
This puts her in a new light.

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:21.910
Is she on a team?

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.990
Why are they all talking about me?

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:24.870
All this attention...

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:29.830
is making it impossible for me
to ask for a bathroom break!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.290
What'll I do?

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:38.670
Minami-sensei!

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:41.350
I feel cold! Can I use the restroom?!

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:43.140
Uh, sure.

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:57.590
Why did you say that in front of everyone, you airhead?

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:58.990
It's better than having an accident!

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:02.780
Next time, whisper it to a teacher!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.230
Hey, don't sweat it!

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:06.210
The boys didn't hear me.

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:07.750
You're missing the point!

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:08.660
Hey!

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:11.460
Are you feeling sick or something?

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.420
Wh-Why ask?

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:19.220
Well, there was that thing yesterday.
And you looked kind of pale.

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:21.300
Did you tell them you had to use the bathroom?

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:23.380
That means...

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.840
He's worried about you!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:29.060
Th... This isn't a good time!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.770
Th-Thanks, but I'm fine.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.310
I beg to differ!

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.270
If something's bothering you, just tell me!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.320
You don't need to hold it in.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.170
Just let it out.

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.530
We live in the same house.

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:47.450
Hey!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.670
We're going to the nurse.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:50.410
Really, I'm fine!

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.070
I can go by myse-

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:54.870
O-Oh no!

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:59.650
I'll find the nurse while you rest here.

00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:10.760
I-If I take even one step, I'll pee!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:13.730
How could I, a teenager, have an accident?

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:22.410
That'll be unbearable!

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:29.530
What'll I do?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:31.990
Mitsuki!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:33.540
Hey, use that!

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:36.290
Huh?

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:43.630
Hurry!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:45.630
The vase?

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.390
B-But... I...

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.930
can't hold it any longer!

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:52.910
I have no choice!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.310
Mitsuki! I got the nurse-

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.150
No...

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:03.900
Oh my...

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.090
Nooo!

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:21.540
Oh god...

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:22.870
That was horrible.

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:26.540
It's not so bad. A female nurse can keep a secret.

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:29.180
And Onii-chan didn't see the T.S.T.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:33.220
But he saw everything else.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:40.190
Mommy, I have to tinkle!

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:44.420
Mommy, where are you?

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:46.110
That's... not what I saw, right?

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:50.030
It looked like she had no underwear on.

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.030
Am I out of my mind?

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:56.150
Mei-chan!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.030
Mommy!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.850
Ah, Neko!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.100
Oh.

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:22.920
Went shopping?

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:23.900
Yeah.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:27.500
I was thinking that I'd make dinner tonight.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.730
Oh, yes. Tonight's your first night.

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:30.240
Hmm?

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.740
Is that why your clothes are covered in drool?

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:35.120
You're wrong!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:38.030
Will you stop lollygagging?

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:40.640
Let's hurry back home!

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:43.580
I can't go back, not after what happened.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:46.460
How am I supposed to face him?

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:47.800
I wish I was dead!

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:50.760
What's stopping you?

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.030
And look where we are.

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:55.730
You can die in the same spot.

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:07.090
Let it go.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:10.210
You've gotten Onii-chan to care for you.

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:12.860
I envy you.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.430
Sorry.

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:22.070
Mitsuki-chan! Are you going home?

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:24.000
Aunt Nanami.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:30.750
My sister was always worrying about you.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:36.830
Only because you two lived by yourselves for a long time, among other issues.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:41.150
So how's your new brother?
Is he easy to get along with?

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:44.480
I... don't know yet.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:46.480
But...

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:56.490
Oh, did someone move in next door?

00:16:59.090 --> 00:17:01.110
Okay, I'll swing by again.

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.590
If anything happens, you have my number.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:05.320
Thank you.

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:06.050
Bye!

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:27.600
What's that sound?

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:34.630
You scared me!

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:37.780
Haven't you ever heard of clothes? You jerk!

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.550
But this is the bathroom.

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:43.490
And she saw <i>me</i> naked.

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:52.500
Perfect!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.830
Dinner's ready!

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:57.130
I'll eat it later.

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:09.020
Hello?

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.210
Ah, Mitsuki?

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.900
You went home after gym. Are you all right?

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.210
Did something happen?

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:15.780
Ayaka.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:20.200
No, I'm fine. I was just a little under the weather.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.010
Well, I'm glad to hear that.

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:28.030
Ah, if you start feeling bad again, you should watch tonight's <i>Healthy Angels.</i>

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:29.870
You know, that TV show?

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:30.750
Vitamin-

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:37.010
Is that a text?

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:42.750
Who's that?

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:47.230
Can't you be a little friendlier with Onii-chan?

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:50.860
Why? We don't have to be friends
in order to live together.

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:53.820
That might be true, in theory.
But are you willing to die?

00:18:56.610 --> 00:19:02.240
Even with that hanging over me, I can't just change how I feel about him.

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:06.130
I also think it sucks how your parents turned your life upside down.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:11.370
I think <i>you're</i> the one who's turning my life upside down.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.380
If something bothering you, just tell me!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.590
We live in the same house.

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.030
Oh?

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:25.950
Was that a twinge you just felt, Mitsuki?

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:26.970
N-No way!

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.230
It's because you saw Onii-chan's little friend!

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:30.710
You naughty girl!

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:31.520
Stop it!
You naughty girl!

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:35.360
This is caused by your feelings for him!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:39.670
This may be the best time to fondle your breasts and make them grow bigger.

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:42.570
Don't!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:07.560
Many other girls touch themselves
while thinking about a guy.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.470
It's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:21.870
I don't think other girls do that.

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:24.150
Really? I'd say it's half and half.

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:26.130
For example... "Ayaka," right?

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.790
I'm positive she does it, too.

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.950
No, you're wrong!

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.710
It's perfectly normal.

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:32.960
I'm getting out!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:40.010
I wish more people would understand that side of girls.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:43.130
No way! The door is broken!

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:46.830
Great. Am I locked in?

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:48.920
What's wrong, Mitsuki?

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:52.520
Can't you open the door?

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.440
I'm coming in.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:58.180
I also locked myself in a while ago.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:01.440
So that was the rattling noise I heard.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.950
I was going to get it repaired tomorrow.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.820
Sorry I didn't warn you.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.970
I can open it from this side.

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:12.280
I'll only open it a crack. You can come out after I leave.

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:13.370
Don't look!

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:14.330
Why would I?

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:19.210
All right. I'm opening it.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.070
Coming through!

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:22.050
Hey!

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.350
Y... You moron!

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:34.730
I can't believe you would come in!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.900
Wait, didn't you pull me in?

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:42.530
Shoot. It won't open.

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:48.290
Wh... What'll we do?

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.810
Please hug me tight.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.410
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:59.290
Come closer to me.

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.170
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:22:13.270 --> 00:22:15.490
I want you to notice

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:18.730
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:21.030
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:24.190
and go full throttle towards you.

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:26.560
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.780
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:32.040
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:35.120
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.750
These ordinary days

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.630
are something special to me.

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:46.130
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:51.850
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:57.270
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:22:57.270 --> 00:22:59.980
You’re my man with the charming do

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.760
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:05.470
Well you see, that’s because

00:23:05.470 --> 00:23:08.490
I love you very much.

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:11.030
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.700
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:16.570
I want to keep on loving you

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:19.200
always and forever more.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:23.960
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual:</i>

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:26.960
But didn't she use to act
like your "big sister"?

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:29.720
That onee-san!

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:31.250
Who's stacked!

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:33.800
And is a childhood friend!

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:36.560
"I loved you ever
since we were kids."

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.980
No, no! What am I thinking?
